#**
 * Renders the body content with possible sections as per configuration.
 *
 * If no sections are defined in the configuration, the body is rendered
 * normally with page header marking.
 *
 *#
#*  *##if ( $config.sections )##
#*      *##renderBodySections ( $bodyContent $config.sections )##
#*  *##else##
#*      *##bodyWithHeader ( $bodyContent )##
#*  *##end##
